Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 16:36:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): log blocker-route fallbacks and offset facade
 growth [daveey]

Catch-all boundaries in _known_model_provider, task_route, record_run_route and
_apply_model_tier keep their conservative fallbacks but now log tracebacks
(exc_info=True). Move attachment-name helpers into kanban_db_attachment_names and
_park_guard into kanban_tools_park_args so kanban_db.py / tools/kanban_tools.py
stay under their main-branch caps.
